  "details": "In the live version, the counter for the number of seconds to be reset works properly, but in the Open-Beta, it accumulates instead of resetting.\n\n1.Join to \"Aoinu Shooting:KILL HOUSE\" World\n\n2.Go to the location of the outdoor steel challenge.\n\n3.Interact the button\n\n4.Shoot the Plate\n\n5.Interact the button. A bug occurs here without resetting.\n\nTwo perspectives from the same time:\n\nFirst photo: View from the Live version user\n\nSecond photo: View from the Open-Beta version user",
